# CageScale data edits

When changing fighter or division seed data:

1. **Fighter id** must stay stable (kebab-case) — used in routes, `fighters_images`, and `fighter-heights.ts`.
2. Every fighter in `data.ts` needs **`fighter-heights.ts`** entry (`heightCm`).
3. Recent champions: update `entities/weight-class/model/champions.ts` (most recent first); keep `RECENT_CHAMPIONS_COUNT` in mind.
4. Do not reintroduce UI that treats `isCurrent` / `isInterim` as user-facing “belt holder” labels.
5. Optional photos: `public/fighters_images/{id}.webp` (jpg/jpeg/png also tried).

After edits: `npm run build`.

Log bulk lineage updates in [docs/DECISIONS.md](../../docs/DECISIONS.md) with research note.
